WEBVTT

00:00:12.340 --> 00:00:14.380
<i>GeGeGe no Kitaro</i>

00:00:15.680 --> 00:00:17.700
The Empress is missing!

00:00:20.930 --> 00:00:22.960
I haven't eaten in a while.

00:00:30.900 --> 00:00:33.740
<i>The world you see isn't all there is.</i>

00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:36.530
<i>There are things you can't see.</i>

00:00:37.030 --> 00:00:40.410
<i>See? In the darkness behind you...</i>

00:00:56.640 --> 00:01:00.310
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:00:56.640 --> 00:01:00.310
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:00.640 --> 00:01:04.230
<i>Slumbering in bed in the morning</i>

00:01:00.640 --> 00:01:04.230
<i>asa wa nedoko de gu gu gu</i>

00:01:05.060 --> 00:01:08.940
<i>It's so fun, it's so fun</i>

00:01:05.060 --> 00:01:08.940
<i>tanoshiina tanoshiina</i>

00:01:09.060 --> 00:01:12.730
<i>Ghosts don't have school</i>

00:01:09.060 --> 00:01:12.730
<i>obakenya gakkou mo</i>

00:01:12.860 --> 00:01:16.610
<i>Or tests or anything</i>

00:01:12.860 --> 00:01:16.610
<i>shiken mo nannimo nai</i>

00:01:17.200 --> 00:01:21.410
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:17.200 --> 00:01:21.410
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:21.540 --> 00:01:25.000
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:21.540 --> 00:01:25.000
<i>minna de utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:25.330 --> 00:01:29.210
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:25.330 --> 00:01:29.210
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:29.630 --> 00:01:33.090
<i>Sports festivals in the graveyard at night</i>

00:01:29.630 --> 00:01:33.090
<i>yoru wa hakaba de undoukai</i>

00:01:33.960 --> 00:01:37.970
<i>It's so fun, it's so fun</i>

00:01:33.960 --> 00:01:37.970
<i>tanoshiina tanoshiina</i>

00:01:38.090 --> 00:01:42.100
<i>Ghosts don't die</i>

00:01:38.090 --> 00:01:42.100
<i>obake wa shinanai</i>

00:01:42.220 --> 00:01:45.520
<i>Or get sick or anything</i>

00:01:42.220 --> 00:01:45.520
<i>byouki mo nannimo nai</i>

00:01:46.390 --> 00:01:49.980
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:46.390 --> 00:01:49.980
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:50.360 --> 00:01:54.320
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:50.360 --> 00:01:54.320
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:54.440 --> 00:01:58.280
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:54.440 --> 00:01:58.280
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:58.780 --> 00:02:03.240
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:58.780 --> 00:02:03.240
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:02:08.310 --> 00:02:10.060
What?! That's hilarious!

00:02:10.190 --> 00:02:13.690
Right? I laughed so hard
my stomach ripped!

00:02:14.270 --> 00:02:17.240
-No way!
-Seriously! I've almost got a six-pack.

00:02:22.240 --> 00:02:23.520
Huh?

00:02:23.520 --> 00:02:26.000
Why is this here?

00:02:29.420 --> 00:02:31.670
What... is this?!

00:02:38.050 --> 00:02:38.970
CHAPTER 46

00:02:39.590 --> 00:02:43.850
THE CURSED DOLL FESTIVAL
MAYUGE

00:02:43.850 --> 00:02:46.220
HAZUKI DOLL STORE

00:02:54.190 --> 00:02:55.480
SEVEN PLATFORM SET
300,000 YEN

00:02:57.900 --> 00:03:02.850
Honestly, these hina dolls are
way too expensive.

00:03:02.850 --> 00:03:05.350
Don't you think so, Ma'am?

00:03:05.350 --> 00:03:07.310
U-Uh, well...

00:03:07.310 --> 00:03:10.460
Let me introduce myself.

00:03:08.450 --> 00:03:10.460
DOLL DEALER
BIBIBI NO RAT MAN

00:03:10.460 --> 00:03:11.690
Oh...

00:03:11.690 --> 00:03:15.230
My company, through its own connections,

00:03:15.230 --> 00:03:20.720
can offer products on par with
this store's at half the price.

00:03:21.300 --> 00:03:24.910
However, due to popularity,
production is behind

00:03:24.910 --> 00:03:29.790
so every doll but the Emperor and Empress
will be shipped later.

00:03:29.790 --> 00:03:31.190
How about it?

00:03:33.600 --> 00:03:34.860
Whoops.

00:03:38.820 --> 00:03:41.320
Everyone's so distrustful.

00:03:46.370 --> 00:03:47.770
Sir.

00:03:47.770 --> 00:03:52.040
I can offer a much better deal on
hina dolls than these.

00:03:53.540 --> 00:03:54.750
Really?

00:03:54.750 --> 00:03:57.340
Yes, absolutely.

00:04:00.050 --> 00:04:02.340
Wow, hina dolls!

00:04:02.340 --> 00:04:05.030
I guess the Doll Festival's almost here.

00:04:05.030 --> 00:04:07.090
But this is wrong.

00:04:07.090 --> 00:04:11.620
How come there's seven platforms
but only the Emperor and Empress?

00:04:11.620 --> 00:04:14.770
Apparently the maker's really popular.

00:04:14.770 --> 00:04:19.110
Production's behind,
so the other dolls will arrive later.

00:04:19.650 --> 00:04:21.110
Kotani-sensei.

00:04:21.570 --> 00:04:22.740
But don't worry.

00:04:23.450 --> 00:04:26.510
They'll all be in time for
the Doll Festival.

00:04:26.510 --> 00:04:27.370
Oh.

00:04:27.950 --> 00:04:32.120
Aren't they impressive? I selected them.

00:04:32.120 --> 00:04:33.900
Hmm.

00:04:33.900 --> 00:04:37.480
What do you mean, "hmm"?
Try to show more interest.

00:04:37.480 --> 00:04:43.130
They decided to set this up this year for
students to appreciate Japanese culture.

00:04:44.090 --> 00:04:48.350
Oh, Japanese culture!
Me find very interesting!

00:04:48.350 --> 00:04:49.750
Honestly...

00:04:49.750 --> 00:04:51.390
Careful on your way home.

00:04:51.390 --> 00:04:53.230
Okay!

00:04:54.690 --> 00:04:56.520
Oh! I forgot my gym wear.

00:04:56.520 --> 00:04:57.540
What?

00:04:57.540 --> 00:05:00.170
Sorry. I'll get it right away.

00:05:00.170 --> 00:05:01.980
Wait for me at the entrance.

00:05:06.610 --> 00:05:08.120
I'm back!

00:05:09.120 --> 00:05:09.870
Huh?

00:05:12.450 --> 00:05:13.870
They went home?

00:05:22.380 --> 00:05:25.170
I asked them to wait.

00:05:25.630 --> 00:05:27.180
Oh, Mana-chan!

00:05:27.180 --> 00:05:29.660
Yuta-kun, what's up?

00:05:29.660 --> 00:05:31.930
We're playing soccer with Hiroto-kun.

00:05:31.930 --> 00:05:35.000
The ball flew into the school.

00:05:35.000 --> 00:05:38.340
-Hey! Hurry and get it!
-Okay!

00:05:38.340 --> 00:05:40.130
Later, Mana-chan.

00:05:40.130 --> 00:05:41.820
Sure. Bye-bye!

00:05:42.940 --> 00:05:46.200
We haven't gone for miso ramen in a while.

00:05:46.700 --> 00:05:49.050
It tastes great with butter.

00:05:49.050 --> 00:05:51.830
I prefer roasted pork.

00:05:56.870 --> 00:05:58.250
What's wrong?

00:05:59.040 --> 00:05:59.920
Nothing...

00:06:07.720 --> 00:06:10.140
Oh, you set up the hina dolls.

00:06:10.590 --> 00:06:13.040
I was a little late this year.

00:06:13.040 --> 00:06:14.710
Wow.

00:06:14.710 --> 00:06:16.920
Be sure to pay your respects.

00:06:16.920 --> 00:06:19.210
Respects? To dolls?

00:06:19.210 --> 00:06:20.290
Yes.

00:06:20.290 --> 00:06:25.840
Hina dolls originally shouldered
all their owners' sin for the year.

00:06:25.840 --> 00:06:29.570
They're precious things that
purify their owners.

00:06:32.620 --> 00:06:36.770
Thank you for everything.
Please continue to protect me.

00:06:36.770 --> 00:06:38.540
Very good.

00:06:40.040 --> 00:06:41.330
Yes, yes.

00:06:43.000 --> 00:06:44.340
Hello?

00:06:45.050 --> 00:06:45.800
What?

00:06:46.460 --> 00:06:49.800
Mana, did you come home with Miyabi-chan?

00:06:49.800 --> 00:06:51.050
No I didn't.

00:06:51.510 --> 00:06:54.390
Miyabi went home ahead
with Aya and Himeka.

00:06:54.930 --> 00:06:56.250
Are you sure?

00:06:56.250 --> 00:07:00.140
Miyabi-chan hasn't come home
and hasn't called.

00:07:00.770 --> 00:07:01.730
What?

00:07:04.610 --> 00:07:06.820
What happened to Miyabi?

00:07:07.740 --> 00:07:11.910
<i>The phone you have called is
currently out of range,</i>

00:07:11.910 --> 00:07:14.240
<i>or has been switched off.</i>

00:07:18.060 --> 00:07:23.690
CALLING AYA

00:07:18.540 --> 00:07:22.610
<i>The phone you have called is
currently out of range,</i>

00:07:22.610 --> 00:07:23.940
<i>or has been...</i>

00:07:23.810 --> 00:07:27.780
CALLING HIMEKA

00:07:23.940 --> 00:07:28.050
<i>The phone you have called is
currently out of range,</i>

00:07:28.050 --> 00:07:29.630
<i>or has been...</i>

00:07:31.880 --> 00:07:34.600
Miyabi, Aya, Himeka!

00:07:36.140 --> 00:07:36.810
Mana?

00:07:36.810 --> 00:07:39.930
Souma, Hiroto. What's wrong?

00:07:41.890 --> 00:07:44.560
Have you seen Yuta at all?

00:07:44.980 --> 00:07:45.940
Yuta-kun?

00:07:45.940 --> 00:07:50.910
You were there after school
when Yuta went to get the ball, right?

00:07:50.910 --> 00:07:51.820
Yeah.

00:07:52.360 --> 00:07:56.080
After that we waited and waited,
but Yuta didn't come back.

00:07:57.410 --> 00:07:59.700
He's not in the school.

00:08:00.830 --> 00:08:03.980
Actually, Miyabi and the others
haven't gone home either.

00:08:03.980 --> 00:08:05.730
Seriously?!

00:08:05.730 --> 00:08:08.240
I'll go check the school.

00:08:08.240 --> 00:08:11.360
You two check places where
Yuta-kun might go!

00:08:11.360 --> 00:08:14.440
Hey wait! Are you going alone?

00:08:14.440 --> 00:08:15.800
It's okay.

00:08:16.550 --> 00:08:19.180
There's someone who'll search with me!

00:08:25.150 --> 00:08:26.940
Cat-san! Kitaro!

00:08:28.020 --> 00:08:32.380
Sorry to call you so suddenly.
I'm not even sure a <i>yokai</i>'s involved.

00:08:32.380 --> 00:08:33.450
No.

00:08:34.320 --> 00:08:38.080
I had my suspicions
ever since passing here earlier.

00:08:39.830 --> 00:08:42.660
I sense an ominous presence.

00:08:44.750 --> 00:08:47.610
It's a big school.
Let's split up and search.

00:08:47.610 --> 00:08:49.320
Holler if there's anything.

00:08:49.320 --> 00:08:50.590
Okay.

00:08:52.630 --> 00:08:56.010
Yuta-kun! Miyabi!

00:08:57.260 --> 00:08:58.760
Aya!

00:08:59.600 --> 00:09:01.180
Himeka!

00:09:03.770 --> 00:09:07.400
Huh? The Three Court Ladies arrived.

00:09:07.730 --> 00:09:10.750
This should be the Five Musicians.

00:09:10.750 --> 00:09:12.360
Why is there only one?

00:09:15.070 --> 00:09:18.570
Yuta-kun, are you here?

00:09:19.140 --> 00:09:21.620
TEACHERS' OFFICE

00:09:20.330 --> 00:09:21.620
I see.

00:09:22.080 --> 00:09:24.060
You still haven't found them.

00:09:24.060 --> 00:09:24.960
Yes.

00:09:24.960 --> 00:09:29.250
I was thinking of
looking through the school again.

00:09:30.040 --> 00:09:31.670
Well, Kitaro?

00:09:31.670 --> 00:09:35.470
I'm certain I sense a <i>yokai</i>'s presence...

00:09:43.680 --> 00:09:45.390
Dolls...

00:09:59.660 --> 00:10:00.780
Dad!

00:10:08.670 --> 00:10:09.420
Kitaro!

00:10:20.260 --> 00:10:22.600
MAYUGE

00:10:23.560 --> 00:10:27.100
DOLL FESTIVAL

00:10:25.120 --> 00:10:26.000
-<i>"Yeah, yeah. You're hot and cold."</i>
-<i>"Huh?!"</i>

00:10:26.120 --> 00:10:27.000
<i>"What'd I do?"</i>

00:10:29.270 --> 00:10:30.100
What?!

00:10:30.600 --> 00:10:32.360
This is Kitaro?!

00:10:35.070 --> 00:10:36.740
The Empress is missing!

00:10:36.740 --> 00:10:41.740
Right. That Empress
turned Kitaro into a doll!

00:10:41.740 --> 00:10:43.530
That's...

00:10:44.280 --> 00:10:46.200
A hina doll did?

00:10:47.250 --> 00:10:49.650
Then Miyabi and the others too...?!

00:10:49.650 --> 00:10:50.620
Probably.

00:10:50.620 --> 00:10:55.570
Sometimes dolls can be
possessed by souls after all.

00:10:55.570 --> 00:10:57.590
Is someone there?

00:10:58.340 --> 00:11:00.470
I heard yelling.

00:11:01.050 --> 00:11:02.160
Kotani-sensei!

00:11:02.160 --> 00:11:02.970
Inuyama?

00:11:02.970 --> 00:11:04.330
At this hour--

00:11:04.330 --> 00:11:07.600
Those hina dolls! Where did you get them?

00:11:08.480 --> 00:11:12.130
Someone approached me at the doll store.

00:11:12.130 --> 00:11:14.340
He said he had a good deal.

00:11:14.340 --> 00:11:18.940
If I remember, his business card said
"BiBiBi no Rat Man"...

00:11:23.070 --> 00:11:26.200
I'll tear him limb from limb!

00:11:34.290 --> 00:11:35.590
I'm stuffed.

00:11:35.590 --> 00:11:39.920
You can't beat
premium Japanese beef bento.

00:11:50.230 --> 00:11:52.540
Start talking.

00:11:52.540 --> 00:11:53.600
Right now!

00:11:55.060 --> 00:11:57.260
What? What are you talking about?

00:11:57.260 --> 00:12:01.320
Because of the dolls you sold,
Kitaro was...

00:12:01.320 --> 00:12:02.680
Dolls?

00:12:02.680 --> 00:12:06.620
I don't know about any
seven platform hina dolls.

00:12:07.330 --> 00:12:10.120
You do know after all!

00:12:11.960 --> 00:12:15.040
Fine, I'll talk! I'll tell you everything!

00:12:15.060 --> 00:12:18.280
DOLL PURIFICATION

00:12:15.960 --> 00:12:18.500
It was three days ago...

00:12:19.510 --> 00:12:21.050
I'm hungry.

00:12:21.920 --> 00:12:25.720
I can't remember when
my last real meal was.

00:12:27.760 --> 00:12:29.930
Ooh! I see some food!

00:12:29.930 --> 00:12:32.140
I'll enjoy this!

00:12:38.770 --> 00:12:42.950
It'd be even better if
there was something valuable.

00:12:46.910 --> 00:12:48.830
Let's see...

00:12:52.790 --> 00:12:54.620
This is...

00:13:02.800 --> 00:13:04.680
I-I-I can't breathe!

00:13:06.090 --> 00:13:07.970
I haven't eaten in a while.

00:13:07.970 --> 00:13:10.140
E-Eaten?!

00:13:11.020 --> 00:13:14.810
Help! I haven't eaten properly
and I smell!

00:13:15.560 --> 00:13:19.110
I should give up my first meal in decades?

00:13:19.820 --> 00:13:23.400
L-Let me go and I'll feed you
tons of healthy humans!

00:13:23.860 --> 00:13:26.240
Humans will definitely taste better!

00:13:31.490 --> 00:13:32.980
In that case...

00:13:32.980 --> 00:13:39.320
sell me to a human as
a seven platform hina doll.

00:13:39.320 --> 00:13:41.440
Seven platform?

00:13:41.440 --> 00:13:44.410
Just do as you're told.

00:13:44.410 --> 00:13:46.120
Right. Got it.

00:13:46.120 --> 00:13:50.890
But what are you? You're not
just some haunted doll, are you?

00:13:53.810 --> 00:13:55.180
I am...

00:13:55.180 --> 00:13:56.600
A Mayuge!

00:13:56.600 --> 00:13:57.960
What?!

00:13:57.960 --> 00:13:59.130
An eyebrow?

00:13:59.130 --> 00:14:00.690
Not that <i>mayuge</i>.

00:14:01.320 --> 00:14:05.970
It's a single hair that was originally
an object of worship for shrines.

00:14:05.970 --> 00:14:10.700
However, Mayuge that aren't enshrined
hide among dolls' hair,

00:14:10.700 --> 00:14:14.580
and live forever, so I'm told.

00:14:15.620 --> 00:14:17.080
MAYUGE

00:14:17.830 --> 00:14:22.230
Mayuge attack living creatures
and absorb their nutrients.

00:14:22.230 --> 00:14:26.420
Those that are absorbed
are turned into dolls.

00:14:27.300 --> 00:14:29.160
There. You see?

00:14:29.160 --> 00:14:31.800
I was threatened and had no choice...

00:14:32.930 --> 00:14:36.270
You'll be taking responsibility.

00:14:39.600 --> 00:14:40.560
What's this?

00:14:40.560 --> 00:14:43.980
Hurry and go be bait!

00:14:46.900 --> 00:14:49.090
Why am I doing this?

00:14:49.090 --> 00:14:51.530
Be sure to lure out the Mayuge!

00:14:56.790 --> 00:15:01.270
Um, why is Rat Man-san dressed like that?

00:15:01.270 --> 00:15:06.550
So far, the Three Court Ladies and two of
the Five Musicians have turned into dolls.

00:15:07.050 --> 00:15:11.950
From that order, the third of
the Five Musicians is the next target.

00:15:11.950 --> 00:15:16.680
The Five Musicians are boys yet to reach
adulthood. In other words, children.

00:15:19.690 --> 00:15:22.340
So that was a kid's disguise.

00:15:22.340 --> 00:15:23.810
It's here!

00:15:24.270 --> 00:15:25.130
There!

00:15:25.130 --> 00:15:26.820
Stay there, Mana!

00:15:32.320 --> 00:15:36.100
Going for a walk?
Sorry for getting in your way.

00:15:36.100 --> 00:15:38.250
If you'll excuse me...

00:15:47.840 --> 00:15:49.010
Upstairs!

00:15:57.850 --> 00:15:59.370
You?

00:15:59.370 --> 00:16:00.850
No matter.

00:16:06.520 --> 00:16:08.110
Rat Man!

00:16:08.820 --> 00:16:10.570
There you are, Mayuge!

00:16:11.150 --> 00:16:13.610
Return Kitaro to normal!

00:16:15.160 --> 00:16:17.330
This isn't a girl doll.

00:16:17.330 --> 00:16:21.480
Kitaro was attacked by the girl doll...

00:16:21.480 --> 00:16:23.360
There were two Mayuge?

00:16:23.360 --> 00:16:24.460
Mana!

00:16:25.000 --> 00:16:26.420
No you don't!

00:16:31.510 --> 00:16:35.430
Then I'll just deal with you first!

00:16:44.900 --> 00:16:46.150
My claws!

00:16:49.360 --> 00:16:52.930
Be careful!
Its hairs are harder than steel!

00:16:52.930 --> 00:16:56.780
Let's see if a kitten's claws can cut me.

00:17:04.960 --> 00:17:08.340
I wonder if Cat-san's all right.

00:17:19.640 --> 00:17:21.140
The head...

00:17:26.440 --> 00:17:27.100
Mana!

00:17:30.020 --> 00:17:31.230
Oh no!

00:18:22.280 --> 00:18:25.500
Kitaro! Yuta-kun! Are you all right?!

00:18:27.460 --> 00:18:28.830
Mana?

00:18:29.290 --> 00:18:30.080
Was I...?

00:18:30.750 --> 00:18:33.960
A <i>yokai</i> called a Mayuge
turned you into a doll!

00:18:34.550 --> 00:18:35.460
Right...

00:18:36.170 --> 00:18:37.620
That doll...

00:18:37.620 --> 00:18:39.390
So it was a Mayuge.

00:18:41.100 --> 00:18:44.060
How did I return to normal?
And the Mayuge?

00:18:44.060 --> 00:18:48.060
Well, it was just here a moment ago.

00:18:49.310 --> 00:18:51.060
Something's upstairs!

00:18:55.820 --> 00:18:57.590
This is a problem.

00:18:57.590 --> 00:19:00.490
A girl can't be one of the Five Musicians.

00:19:01.070 --> 00:19:02.930
I'll use this one.

00:19:02.930 --> 00:19:04.450
Let go of me!

00:19:04.450 --> 00:19:06.000
Why you...!

00:19:07.120 --> 00:19:09.080
Remote Controlled Geta!

00:19:16.260 --> 00:19:18.630
Catchick! Are you okay?

00:19:19.630 --> 00:19:20.660
Kitaro!

00:19:20.660 --> 00:19:21.720
Dad!

00:19:22.260 --> 00:19:24.680
